### Q7. Previous and next multiple of 100

```javascript
let num = Number(prompt("Enter a three digit number:"));

if (num >= 100 && num <= 999) {
    let previous = Math.floor(num / 100) * 100;
    let next = previous + 100;

    console.log("Previous multiple :", previous);
    console.log("Next multiple :", next);
} else {
    console.log("Invalid Input");
}
```

